# THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC. anything that is not about building or using
# r4dio stays out of it: plans, specs, design briefs, working notes, agent
# transcripts, logs, credentials. they describe our deploy layout, server
# users and internal service names, and none of that belongs in a public tree.
# keep them on disk or in the private mirror. when in doubt, do not commit it.

